<%@ include file="layout/header.jsp" %>
<div class="title-row"><div><span class="eyebrow">Operator configuration</span><h1>Symbols, markers and filters</h1></div><a class="button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/map-overview">Back to live map</a></div>
<section class="panel"><h2>Marker symbols</h2><p>Define the marker label, CSS class and description used by the map for vehicle states, station types and operational locations. These settings are saved in this browser and can be reset without affecting the kernel.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Asset key</th><th>Symbol</th><th>CSS class</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody id="marker-config-rows"></tbody></table></div><p class="toolbar"><button id="save-marker-config">Save marker config</button><button id="reset-marker-config" type="button">Reset defaults</button><button id="export-marker-config" type="button">Export JSON</button></p><textarea id="marker-config-json" rows="8" placeholder="Paste exported marker JSON to import"></textarea><p><button id="import-marker-config" type="button">Import JSON</button></p></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Default map filters</h2><p>Choose which overlay groups should be visible when the live map opens.</p><div id="default-layer-config" class="mini-kpis"></div><p><button id="save-layer-config" type="button">Save default layers</button></p></section>
<script defer src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/static/js/config.js"></script><%@ include file="layout/footer.jsp" %>
